    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/412e2895139dab8325c6b7c52edb851d.avif?t=1747476354\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.poster.avif?t=1747476354\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.webm?t=1747476354\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/6828fef27af90e663c8e323af186f399.mp4?t=1747476354\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STEEL THYSELF, AND DESCEND!</h2>The servants of T\u0334\u0344\u0328h\u0334\u031b\u0349e\u0337\u034c\u0326 \u0337\u0341\u0321I\u0337\u0310\u032bn\u0335\u0301\u0326v\u0338\u0344\u0322e\u0337\u0350\u0347r\u0337\u034b\u0329t\u0337\u0344\u0348e\u0338\u033d\u0330d\u0335\u0306\u032c \u0335\u0300\u0345T\u0336\u0344\u0316o\u0335\u034b\u034ew\u0336\u033e\u0339e\u0338\u034a\u034er\u0337\u035d\u032c  venture forth each night, dragging the meek and fearful from their homes down into the Tower's abyssal depths, never to return.<br><br>It is up to <strong>you</strong> to brave the dangers beneath the earth. Up to you to slay those behind the horror.<br><br>To descend ever deeper... INTO EVIL.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/baff2c42e761ca81b64a98d7381fe68a.avif?t=1747476354\" /></div><br>More than just bundles of stats, every item in INTO EVIL is unique and <strong>actually</strong> changes the way you play.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unique movesets:</strong> Swords parry, axes cleave, lanterns still shine when stowed - <i>every</i> item has two moves (and often hidden secrets!)<br></li><li><strong>Enchantments and Curses:</strong> Find items <strong>imbued with dark magic</strong> that radically changes their properties! Infused spells, elemental affinities, mutations, and more - expect the unexpected.<br></li><li><strong>Abilities, not stats:</strong> No &quot;+2% fire resist&quot; here - rather than small stat increments, weapons and armor unlock new abilities and powers to face your enemies with.</li></ul><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/2d117a6c830c803f13bab69c0bae2893.avif?t=1747476354\" /></div><br>The adventure that awaits you is deadly and unpredictable - no matter how many times you face it.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unexpected dangers:</strong> The dungeons of the T\u0334\u0344\u0328h\u0334\u031b\u0349e\u0337\u034c\u0326 \u0337\u0341\u0321I\u0337\u0310\u032bn\u0335\u0301\u0326v\u0338\u0344\u0322e\u0337\u0350\u0347r\u0337\u034b\u0329t\u0337\u0344\u0348e\u0338\u033d\u0330d\u0335\u0306\u032c \u0335\u0300\u0345T\u0336\u0344\u0316o\u0335\u034b\u034ew\u0336\u033e\u0339e\u0338\u034a\u034er\u0337\u035d\u032c are labyrinthine and cursed, <strong>changing their layout</strong> each time you attempt to brave them.<br></li><li><strong>Meaningful choices:</strong> Not only are items powerful, they are <i>scarce</i> and you can only take what you can carry. Foes, traps, and hazards shift each time you die - but your <strong>choices</strong> will shape each Descent as well.<br></li><li><strong>Die, die again:</strong> INTO EVIL is difficult - every enemy is a significant threat and cannot be taken lightly. You will need to learn to adapt to the dangers that confront you, or you will perish brutally.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1893440/extras/3618a5e2b2242940c0666a3c123df2d2.avif?t=1747476354\" /></div><br>Descend into a world gone mad - devils and death, torture and madness await.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Face the Hordes of Hell:</strong> Demons infest the dungeons of INTO EVIL, wielding terrible supernatural powers. You will need every ounce of skill and courage you can muster in order to survive.<br></li><li><strong>Heroes turned betrayers:</strong> The T\u0334\u0344\u0328h\u0334\u031b\u0349e\u0337\u034c\u0326 \u0337\u0341\u0321I\u0337\u0310\u032bn\u0335\u0301\u0326v\u0338\u0344\u0322e\u0337\u0350\u0347r\u0337\u034b\u0329t\u0337\u0344\u0348e\u0338\u033d\u0330d\u0335\u0306\u032c \u0335\u0300\u0345T\u0336\u0344\u0316o\u0335\u034b\u034ew\u0336\u033e\u0339e\u0338\u034a\u034er\u0337\u035d\u032c has been taken over by former heroes who now side with evil. What caused this turn? What dark purpose possesses them?<br></li><li><strong>Dark secrets await:</strong> Learn th\u0336\u0344\u0349e\u0334\u0342\u0322 t\u0336\u0302\u033ce\u0334\u0351\u0319r\u0336\u0358\u0355r\u0336\u0344\u035a\u0349i\u0337\u0344\u0355b\u0336\u035b\u033b\u0356l\u0338\u0308\u031ce\u0337\u0357\u031c \u0335\u031b\u0312\u0353 t\u0335\u035d\u0330\u031cr\u0336\u031a\u0344\u0331\u032au\u0338\u0358\u033e\u032a\u0354t\u0336\u0300\u031f\u035ch\u0336\u0313\u0308\u033a,\u0335\u030d\u0343\u034e \u0338\u030d\u0327t\u0334\u035b\u031b\u0324\u0322h\u0334\u0305\u0349\u034ea\u0334\u0357\u030d\u034d\u0316t\u0338\u0350\u0305\u0328\u033a\u2588\u0338\u035d\u0340\u0322\u2588\u0335\u0301\u033c \u0338\u031b\u035d\u032c\u0317\u2588\u0338\u0358\u033b\u0329 \u0336\u0305\u0321\u0319\u2588\u0337\u0305\u0323\u034e\u2588\u0336\u0352\u0339\u2588\u0338\u033e\u0342\u032a \u0336\u0343\u032f\u0328\u2588\u0335\u0350\u031a\u035a\u2588\u0334\u030f\u0360\u032d\u031e \u0334\u0305\u0326\u2588\u0334\u0352\u0322\u0318\u2588\u0338\u0305\u032d\u2588\u0337\u0340\u0325\u2588\u0335\u035d\u0322\u2588\u0335\u0314\u034a\u0332\u0317\u2588\u0334\u0351\u035b\u031e\u0333\u2588\u0337\u0342\u032b\u034d\u2588\